{
  "id": "the-simpsons---6x23---the-springfield-connection",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 6x23 - The Springfield Connection",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 6x23 - The Springfield Connection.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T20:06:10.592Z",
  "lineCount": 294,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Springfield Connection",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 3569,
      "endMs": 5190
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Aren't you glad we got out of the house and came downtown for a little culture?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 39259,
      "endMs": 43155
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "They're butchering the classics.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 44121,
      "endMs": 46052
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Could that bassoon have come in any more late?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 46224,
      "endMs": 49052
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Oh, come on, Homer. There's lasers. You like lasers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 49293,
      "endMs": 52914
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Laser effects, mirrored balls...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 53086,
      "endMs": 54879
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "...John Williams must be rolling around in his grave.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 55086,
      "endMs": 57845
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Devil-iciously satirical. I wonder if anyone else got that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 62603,
      "endMs": 66500
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "We're out of here!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 66672,
      "endMs": 68534
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Be careful. These are dangerous streets for us upper-lower-middle-class types.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 71155,
      "endMs": 75190
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "So avoid eye contact, watch your pocketbook, and suspect everyone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 75362,
      "endMs": 80362
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Three-card monte. Easy money!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 80534,
      "endMs": 82707
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Homer, these games are fixed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 82914,
      "endMs": 84569
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Then how come that guy's winning?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 84741,
      "endMs": 86845
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "I, like, totally won again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 87190,
      "endMs": 89155
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Way to go, bro!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 89328,
      "endMs": 91121
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "He looks and acts just like the dealer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 91328,
      "endMs": 93741
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "I think they're related, or at least in cahoots.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 93914,
      "endMs": 96397
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Just pick the red card. It's totally not hard.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 96603,
      "endMs": 99776
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Twenty on this one, my good man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 102914,
      "endMs": 104914
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Sorry, dude. Black.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 105707,
      "endMs": 107707
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Homer, he cheated you!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 110603,
      "endMs": 112672
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "You're giving three-car monte a bad name!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 112914,
      "endMs": 114914
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Surely you don't blame me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 115086,
      "endMs": 117190
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "It's people like you who are ruining our downtown promenades and piazzas.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 117500,
      "endMs": 121190
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "How dare you prey on the greedy and stupid like this!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 121362,
      "endMs": 124328
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Bye-bye! Somebody stop him!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 124534,
      "endMs": 127086
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "He's getting away! Come on! Come on!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 128948,
      "endMs": 132086
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "No, Marge!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 132293,
      "endMs": 133845
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "I must warn you...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 163983,
      "endMs": 165879
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "...sometimes ordinary people get a surge of adrenaline.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 167052,
      "endMs": 171879
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "See? Cuff him, boys.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 176466,
      "endMs": 178293
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "We're putting this dirtbag away.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 178466,
      "endMs": 180086
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "I'll be back on the street in 24 hours.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 180948,
      "endMs": 183914
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "We'll try to make it 12.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 184121,
      "endMs": 186121
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Marge, are you okay?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 190707,
      "endMs": 192707
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "I think I'm okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 192914,
      "endMs": 194224
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "It was scary, but in a weird way it was also kind of exhilarating.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 194397,
      "endMs": 198155
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Yes. It is exhilarating to see police get their man and save a hysterical woman.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 198328,
      "endMs": 203052
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Oh, for crying out loud.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 203224,
      "endMs": 205500
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Easy, now, sweetheart. Homie's here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 205707,
      "endMs": 208948
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Hey, Mom. Is this how you caught him?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 210466,
      "endMs": 213052
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Face it, Lis. You're too puny to...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 214052,
      "endMs": 216155
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Lisa, unhand your brother.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 218776,
      "endMs": 220086
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Yeah, like that really hurt.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 222672,
      "endMs": 224776
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Mom, was catching that guy the most exciting thing you've ever done?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 227838,
      "endMs": 231390
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Well, it was pretty exciting.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 231562,
      "endMs": 233631
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "But celery soup's pretty exciting too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 233838,
      "endMs": 238010
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Strange. Regular ham doesn't thrill me anymore.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 248838,
      "endMs": 253838
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "I'm crossing over to deviled ham.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 254010,
      "endMs": 257252
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Marge!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 279631,
      "endMs": 281114
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Hey, Mrs. Simpson, I just got the new issue of Sponge and Vacuum.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 281597,
      "endMs": 284907
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Thanks, Benevenstanciano.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 285045,
      "endMs": 287286
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Death sports.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 292148,
      "endMs": 293700
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "All right, get in there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 305114,
      "endMs": 306493
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "You're going down. I want a piece of him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 306700,
      "endMs": 309010
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "You think you're pretty hot, huh? Well, we got everything we need on you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 309217,
      "endMs": 314424
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Excuse me. What? What? What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 315355,
      "endMs": 317355
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "What? What? What? This better be about pizza.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 317528,
      "endMs": 319941
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Actually, I'm interested in becoming a police officer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 320114,
      "endMs": 323493
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Welcome aboard.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 338562,
      "endMs": 339872
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "You did what?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 340079,
      "endMs": 342355
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "I borrowed your nail clipper. What's the big deal?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 342562,
      "endMs": 344976
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Nothing. I'm just edgy since your mother told me she wants to be a cop.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 345148,
      "endMs": 348597
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Cool! Will you bring me along when you do evictions?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 348769,
      "endMs": 351252
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "You got it, little buddy. You being a cop makes you the man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 351424,
      "endMs": 355321
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Which makes me the woman. And I have no interest in that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 355562,
      "endMs": 358666
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Besides occasionally wearing the underwear...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 358907,
      "endMs": 361183
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "...which, as we discussed, is strictly a comfort thing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 361355,
      "endMs": 364079
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Homer, there's no reason for you to feel threatened.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 365052,
      "endMs": 367534
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "You'll always be the man of this house.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 367741,
      "endMs": 370466
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Thanks, honey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 370638,
      "endMs": 372534
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "All right, you scrawny beanpoles.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 374259,
      "endMs": 376293
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Becoming a cop is not something that happens overnight.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 376534,
      "endMs": 379948
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "It takes one solid weekend of training to get that badge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 380293,
      "endMs": 383121
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Forget about the badge! When do we get the freaking guns?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 383362,
      "endMs": 386500
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Hey, I told you, you don't get your gun until you tell me your name.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 386672,
      "endMs": 390017
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "I've had it up to here with your \"rules\"!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 390190,
      "endMs": 393914
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Women always have trouble with the wall.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 409052,
      "endMs": 410914
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "They never seem to find the door.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 411638,
      "endMs": 413534
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "You missed the baby. You missed the blind man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 432293,
      "endMs": 434431
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Oh. Sorry, Simpson. You'll have to do the course again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 449259,
      "endMs": 452155
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "I was trying to get this Magic Eye thing to work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 452328,
      "endMs": 455397
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Look at that. A pony.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 455914,
      "endMs": 458431
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Hey, everybody! Mom's home.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 463934,
      "endMs": 466590
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "They didn't have my size shirt, but you get the idea.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 469934,
      "endMs": 473176
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Wow, Mom. I never pictured you as any kind of authority figure before.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 474452,
      "endMs": 478314
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Marge, I want you to take care of yourself out there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 478521,
      "endMs": 481279
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "You've become very dear to me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 481417,
      "endMs": 483831
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Homie, of course I will.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 484003,
      "endMs": 485693
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "Mom, if someone shot at the mayor, would you have to take the bullet?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 485866,
      "endMs": 489693
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "I suppose I would. What about a Coke machine?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 489900,
      "endMs": 492555
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "No. TV?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 492762,
      "endMs": 493831
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "No. TV with a picture of the mayor on it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 494003,
      "endMs": 496210
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Whatever you do, we'll be proud of you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 496417,
      "endMs": 498486
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Well, thank you, honey. As long as it's constitutional.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 498693,
      "endMs": 502038
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Homer, give me my pepper spray!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 503555,
      "endMs": 505590
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Oh, Marge. One squirt and you're south of the border.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 505762,
      "endMs": 508900
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Incapacitating.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 511521,
      "endMs": 513624
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "All right, settle, people. People, settle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 517567,
      "endMs": 519900
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "People. Ward and Van Zuylen, stake out Doughnut Land.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 520100,
      "endMs": 523233
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "When they fry up a fresh batch, call it in.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 523400,
      "endMs": 525500
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Keneally and Earhart, back them up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 525700,
      "endMs": 527333
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Fitz and Garcia, it's your turn to sleep in.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 527500,
      "endMs": 529767
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "And, Simpson...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 532633,
      "endMs": 534100
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "...seeing how this is your first day...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 534233,
      "endMs": 536100
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "...you're inexperienced and vulnerable...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 536267,
      "endMs": 538467
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "...your beat is Junkyville and Bumtown.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 538633,
      "endMs": 541033
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Hello, Mr. Hutz.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 546833,
      "endMs": 548167
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "I'll have you know the contents of that dumpster are private.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 548333,
      "endMs": 551233
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "You stick your nose in, you'll be violating attorney-dumpster confidentiality.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 551367,
      "endMs": 555267
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "I just wanted to say hello.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 555500,
      "endMs": 557133
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Hello.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 558500,
      "endMs": 559867
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "You are the new cop on the beat?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 570400,
      "endMs": 572400
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Okay. I know the drill.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 572567,
      "endMs": 574333
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "What will it be? One hundred? Two hundred?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 574500,
      "endMs": 576500
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Two hundred. No, no. I mean, nothing. I don't take bribes!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 576700,
      "endMs": 580567
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Yes, of course you don't.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 580733,
      "endMs": 582367
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "I will just leave this money on the table...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 582867,
      "endMs": 585067
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "...with my unseeing back to the money on the table.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 585233,
      "endMs": 588100
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Apu, no.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 588300,
      "endMs": 590633
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "That's better. That's better.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 593367,
      "endMs": 594800
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "What are you gonna do with your day off?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 596200,
      "endMs": 598233
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "I just want to relax and forget that I'm part...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 598433,
      "endMs": 601267
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "...of that thin blue line which stands between civilization and chaos.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 601433,
      "endMs": 605767
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "It's illegal for you to operate that class-9 vehicle without pads and a helmet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 608367,
      "endMs": 613200
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "But, Mom... It's for your own safety.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 613400,
      "endMs": 615433
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Take that, safety boy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 617300,
      "endMs": 619667
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "This padding's so easy on the knuckles, I could punch all day!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 619900,
      "endMs": 625067
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "I just hope they have Us magazine in heaven.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 626350,
      "endMs": 628917
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "He said it was his day to use the tub pillow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 629083,
      "endMs": 631150
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "I can't go to the library anymore. Everybody stinks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 631317,
      "endMs": 633717
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Don't stop talking on account of me. I may be a cop, but I'm still your friend.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 637950,
      "endMs": 642517
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "So how are you, Mrs. Krabappel?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 643783,
      "endMs": 645850
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Law-abiding. I'm done.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 646017,
      "endMs": 648450
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Moe, I've never seen you here before.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 650917,
      "endMs": 653450
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Well, these days, my roots don't stay so chestnut on their own, Officer Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 653617,
      "endMs": 658750
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "You don't have to call me \"officer.\" I'm not on duty here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 658917,
      "endMs": 662250
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Finished.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 662417,
      "endMs": 663683
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Looks nice. It's a good length for you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 667783,
      "endMs": 670950
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Mom's police tape isn't a toy, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 676450,
      "endMs": 679183
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Shush, dear. You'll wreck Daddy's fun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 679350,
      "endMs": 682417
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Oh, my Lord! Something horrible has happened!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 686650,
      "endMs": 689217
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Fooled you, Flanders.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 693350,
      "endMs": 694617
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Made you think your family was dead!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 694783,
      "endMs": 697483
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Did you get it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 701783,
      "endMs": 703350
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "They're not, though.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 704417,
      "endMs": 705850
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "But you thought they were. Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 707117,
      "endMs": 708817
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "That's why it was so funny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 709017,
      "endMs": 711217
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "But they're not.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 711483,
      "endMs": 712750
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "That's a good one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 713017,
      "endMs": 714283
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "And that's the drunk tank, and this is Mommy's desk.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 714550,
      "endMs": 717583
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Mom, I know your intentions are good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 717850,
      "endMs": 719683
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "But aren't police a force that maintains the status quo for the wealthy elite?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 719817,
      "endMs": 723483
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Don't you think we should attack social problems...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 723617,
      "endMs": 725983
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "...instead of jamming people into overcrowded prisons?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 726150,
      "endMs": 728617
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Look, Lisa! It's McGriff the Crime Dog.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 729950,
      "endMs": 733017
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Hello, Lisa. Help me bite crime.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 733217,
      "endMs": 737017
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Hey, great news, guys! I picked up a nudie deck for our game.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 739717,
      "endMs": 743917
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "\"The girls of the Internet.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 744083,
      "endMs": 745983
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "I'd go online with them any day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 746150,
      "endMs": 749550
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Hey, hey! We've offended Herman.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 750383,
      "endMs": 752383
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "No, I'm just going out for some fresh air.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 752550,
      "endMs": 754983
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "That guy sure likes his fresh air.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 755817,
      "endMs": 757750
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "None of that for me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 757917,
      "endMs": 759850
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Oh, yeah... Oh, yeah, yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 760583,
      "endMs": 764017
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Homer, you sure it's okay to smoke Cuban cigars and gamble...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 764250,
      "endMs": 767150
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "...now that your wife's a cop? - Are you kidding?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 767350,
      "endMs": 769583
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Being a cop husband is one mighty sweet deal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 769750,
      "endMs": 772483
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "This police radio entertains me with other people's miseries...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 772583,
      "endMs": 775517
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "...we get a free funeral for Marge, God forbid...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 775683,
      "endMs": 777950
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "...and I can run background checks on whomever I want, Momar.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 778117,
      "endMs": 782983
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Please, please. Lx-nay on the Omar-may.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 783150,
      "endMs": 786583
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Hurry it up with the cards, Lenny. I've got you clocked at two miles per hour.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 788850,
      "endMs": 792417
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Put that away. Radar guns give you cancer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 792583,
      "endMs": 794717
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "All the more reason to hurry up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 794917,
      "endMs": 796750
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "Hey, what could be going 100 miles per...?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 796917,
      "endMs": 798917
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Illegal gambling in my house?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 801017,
      "endMs": 803750
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Your house? Your house?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 803950,
      "endMs": 806083
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Gee, it's so glamorously decorated, I thought I was in Vegas.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 806217,
      "endMs": 809983
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Hey, you guys lied to me! You said it was Vegas!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 810183,
      "endMs": 812717
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "We'll be going. We'll just be going. See you around.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 812917,
      "endMs": 815683
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Marge, you chased away all my poker buddies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 815817,
      "endMs": 818483
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "I didn't mean to.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 818650,
      "endMs": 819983
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "You've become such a cop.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 820250,
      "endMs": 821983
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "Not that long ago, you were so much more to me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 822150,
      "endMs": 824483
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "You were a cleaner of pots, a sewer of buttons, an unplugger of hairy clogs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 824783,
      "endMs": 829283
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "I'm still all those things.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 829483,
      "endMs": 831150
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Only now I'm cleaning up the city, sewing together the social fabric...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 831317,
      "endMs": 835050
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "...and unplugging the clogs of our legal system.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 835283,
      "endMs": 837883
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "You're cooking what for dinner?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 838017,
      "endMs": 839450
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Everywhere I look, someone is breaking the law.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 842083,
      "endMs": 845083
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Dog, no leash. Man littering.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 845683,
      "endMs": 849350
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "Horse not wearing diaper.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 849483,
      "endMs": 851350
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Car parked across three handicapped spaces.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 852717,
      "endMs": 856517
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Homer! Hey, Marge. How's my little piglet?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 856717,
      "endMs": 859683
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Homer, I'm on duty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 859850,
      "endMs": 861983
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "That's okay. I'm supposed to be working too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 862150,
      "endMs": 864783
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "You have to move your car.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 864950,
      "endMs": 866450
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "I'll just be a second, Marge. I'm going to get some beer for those kids over there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 866617,
      "endMs": 870983
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "I'm gonna pretend I didn't hear that. But you have to move your car now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 871750,
      "endMs": 876317
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "I'll be right back. Now keep your eyes peeled for a real cop.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 876483,
      "endMs": 879683
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "That's it! I'm gonna write you a ticket!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 879850,
      "endMs": 881817
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Come on! We're family! You're breaking the law!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 882017,
      "endMs": 884483
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "I'll make you a deal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 884750,
      "endMs": 885883
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "You rip up that ticket and I'll give you back your hat!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 886017,
      "endMs": 889450
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Homer, taking an officer's cap is an arrestable offense.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 893950,
      "endMs": 898083
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "What are you gonna do about it? What are you gonna do, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 898417,
      "endMs": 901317
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "\"I'm Officer Marge. I'm gonna arrest you. \" Whoa! What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 901450,
      "endMs": 905850
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "Marge, not here. Hey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 906150,
      "endMs": 908817
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "You're not really arresting me? You have the right to remain silent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 908950,
      "endMs": 912150
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "I choose to waive that right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 912383,
      "endMs": 914250
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "All right, Simpson. You're free to go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 922550,
      "endMs": 924383
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Let me just finish this last lobster tail and raspberry torte.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 925317,
      "endMs": 928950
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "All right, Hans. Time to go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 930117,
      "endMs": 932750
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "But he ate my last meal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 932950,
      "endMs": 934917
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "If that's the worst thing that happens to you today, consider yourself lucky.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 935083,
      "endMs": 938750
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "Are you really allowed to execute people in a local jail?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 938917,
      "endMs": 942150
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "From this point on, no talking.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 942350,
      "endMs": 943917
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "I'm sorry I had to arrest you, Homer, but what I did was right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 947550,
      "endMs": 951617
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "When you need it, you'll be happy there are dedicated cops like me out there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 951783,
      "endMs": 955883
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "I have nothing more to say to you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 956050,
      "endMs": 957783
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "I'm drawing a line down the center of the house, � la I Love Lucy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 957950,
      "endMs": 961083
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "You stay on your side and I'll stay on my side.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 961283,
      "endMs": 964383
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "Boy, when Marge first told me she was going to the police academy...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 967083,
      "endMs": 970283
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "...I thought it'd be fun and exciting. You know, like that movie Spaceballs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 970417,
      "endMs": 973950
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "Instead it's been painful and disturbing, like that movie Police Academy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 974117,
      "endMs": 977483
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "Hey, Homer. I'm worried about the beer supply.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 977650,
      "endMs": 980083
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "After this case, and the other case, there's only one case left!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 980283,
      "endMs": 984517
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Yeah, yeah! Barney's right!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 984650,
      "endMs": 986750
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Yeah, let's drink some beer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 986883,
      "endMs": 988717
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "What about some beer? Yeah, Barney's right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 988883,
      "endMs": 991050
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "All right, guys. Pipe down. I got some more in the garage.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 991317,
      "endMs": 994650
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "No. I'll get it for you, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 994817,
      "endMs": 997450
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "I wonder why he's so eager to go to the garage.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 999550,
      "endMs": 1002183
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "The garage. Hey, fellas! The garage.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1002350,
      "endMs": 1004683
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "Well, la-di-da, Mr. Frenchman.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1004817,
      "endMs": 1007383
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "Well, what do you call it? A car hole.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1007583,
      "endMs": 1009617
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "You're late, Herman. Surely you don't mind waiting...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1014650,
      "endMs": 1017217
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "...for merchandise of this quality, Mr. Jericho?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1017383,
      "endMs": 1019617
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Looks like good stuff. But, of course, I'll have to sample it first.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1020517,
      "endMs": 1024450
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "These are fabulous!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1025283,
      "endMs": 1027183
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "Yeah. Who would suspect that they're counterfeit jeans?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1027350,
      "endMs": 1031617
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "What better place to make the buy...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1031983,
      "endMs": 1033683
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "...than in a cop's garage, where no one would suspect a thing?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1033750,
      "endMs": 1037250
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Herman, I had to come out here to see what's so funny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1043417,
      "endMs": 1046350
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "A counterfeit-jeans ring operating out of my car hole!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1046517,
      "endMs": 1049383
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "I'm gonna tell everyone! Wait here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1049550,
      "endMs": 1051983
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Not so fast.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1052283,
      "endMs": 1053717
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1053883,
      "endMs": 1055850
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "Maybe you should just stop entirely.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1058283,
      "endMs": 1060750
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "Herman, how could you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1061317,
      "endMs": 1062917
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "We've all thought about counterfeiting jeans.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1063150,
      "endMs": 1065717
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "But what about the victims?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1065883,
      "endMs": 1067350
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "Hardworking designers like Calvin Klein, Gloria Vanderbilt or Antoine Bugle Boy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1067483,
      "endMs": 1072717
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "These are the people who saw an overcrowded marketplace...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1072883,
      "endMs": 1075817
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "...and said, \"Me too!\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1075950,
      "endMs": 1077383
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "Advance on him, men.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1077583,
      "endMs": 1079283
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "I don't think that's a very good idea.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1079483,
      "endMs": 1082383
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "Oh, no! It's Gloria Vanderbilt out for revenge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1082583,
      "endMs": 1085383
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "No, it's Officer Simpson of the police.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1085583,
      "endMs": 1089683
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Herman, your beef is with me! Leave the girl out of this!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1094817,
      "endMs": 1098017
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "Okay. Homer!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1098183,
      "endMs": 1100717
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "It's too late for me, Marge! Sell the jeans and live like a queen!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1100917,
      "endMs": 1104350
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Is Bart home?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1107117,
      "endMs": 1108683
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "Just taking Maggie for a stroll.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1109217,
      "endMs": 1111550
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "I guess I am putting up the Halloween decorations a little early.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1114483,
      "endMs": 1117917
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "Criticism accepted.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1118183,
      "endMs": 1119683
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "Marge!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1120650,
      "endMs": 1122750
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "Go, Mom! Bust him! All right, Mom!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1123817,
      "endMs": 1126050
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "Go back to bed! Don't make me come up there!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1126217,
      "endMs": 1129583
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "Looks like your wife is embarking up the wrong tree.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1135683,
      "endMs": 1139617
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "Freeze! Every mother knows the secret entrance to her son's tree house.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1143450,
      "endMs": 1147350
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "Oh, Marge, you saved my life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1147517,
      "endMs": 1150483
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "I'm sorry I teased you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1150650,
      "endMs": 1152617
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "You're a really good cop. I'm proud of you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1152817,
      "endMs": 1156550
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "So long. Gotta catch the 501.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1158250,
      "endMs": 1160117
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "He's getting away! You blew it, Marge. I don't think so.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1160350,
      "endMs": 1163650
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "Foiled by my own shoddy merchandise!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1164917,
      "endMs": 1167483
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "That's my ambulance! I called for it four hours ago!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1167983,
      "endMs": 1170383
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "Marge, how did you know?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1170550,
      "endMs": 1172117
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "That the pants would rip? No. What...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1172250,
      "endMs": 1173983
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "Years of buying pants for children and a full-seated husband...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1174183,
      "endMs": 1177150
    },
    {
      "index": 283,
      "text": "...has given me a sixth sense for shoddy stitching...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1177350,
      "endMs": 1179783
    },
    {
      "index": 284,
      "text": "...which these jeans have in spades.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1179950,
      "endMs": 1181650
    },
    {
      "index": 285,
      "text": "That's nice work, Simpson, but we can't hold him. There's no evidence.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1181817,
      "endMs": 1185017
    },
    {
      "index": 286,
      "text": "There's a garage full of counterfeit jeans.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1185250,
      "endMs": 1187283
    },
    {
      "index": 287,
      "text": "They've mysteriously disappeared.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1187683,
      "endMs": 1190617
    },
    {
      "index": 288,
      "text": "Looking good, boys.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1191117,
      "endMs": 1192417
    },
    {
      "index": 289,
      "text": "That's it. There's too much corruption on this force. I quit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1192617,
      "endMs": 1196983
    },
    {
      "index": 290,
      "text": "Sorry to lose you, Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1208683,
      "endMs": 1209950
    },
    {
      "index": 291,
      "text": "I don't think they're coming back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1212783,
      "endMs": 1214450
    },
    {
      "index": 292,
      "text": "Well, that does it. That does it. I'm looking at his cards.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1214583,
      "endMs": 1217317
    },
    {
      "index": 293,
      "text": "Crap. I fold. www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1217450,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 6,
    "episode": 23
  }
}
